      {"id": "confirm-design", "title": "Confirm design with user", "category": "confirm", "description": "Present the design proposal for user approval.", "dependencies": ["operational-discovery"]}
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  
  ### Existing tasks
  
  The following tasks already exist. Tasks with status 'done' or 'active' must NOT be replaced — only produce new tasks for work that is still pending. You may drop, reorder, or add pending tasks as needed.
  
